# The Movie Database (TMDB) API key
# Get one free at https://www.themoviedb.org/settings/api
#
# Copy this file to `.env` (already gitignored) and fill in your key:
#   VITE_TMDB_API_KEY=your_key_here
#
# Either a v3 "API Key" or a v4 "API Read Access Token" works: a v3 key is sent
# as the `api_key` query parameter and a v4 token is sent as a Bearer header.
#
# Without a key the site keeps working and renders its local generated
# poster artwork; with a key it fetches real TMDB posters for every title.
VITE_TMDB_API_KEY=

# Optional overrides for the Contact Us section (defaults live in src/data/site.js):
#   VITE_CONTACT_EMAIL=reponsefrank88@gmail.com
#   VITE_CONTACT_PHONE=0792183063
#   VITE_CONTACT_LOCATION=London, United Kingdom